# Solar Ridge (Expansion E1): optional plateau north of Voltara City. Solar panel fields, a reservoir for
# fishing, the Ridge Station (Machine Part quest) and a crystal grotto behind a cracked rock (Rock Smash).
map p4a_solar_ridge
name "Solar Ridge"
location "Solar Ridge"
music route_mid
environment grass
region 20 14
encounters p4a_solar_ridge
connect south voltara_city 0

